{"seq":2,"slug":"price-capture-drop-detection-scheduler","title":"价格采集、降价检测与调度去抖机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/restock-price-alert-engine/price-capture-drop-detection-scheduler","wordCount":2766,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"价格采集-降价检测与调度去抖机制\">价格采集、降价检测与调度去抖机制</h1><p>上一篇定义了「什么样的价格迁移才构成一次触发」的<strong>语义</strong>；这一篇处理支撑那套语义的<strong>管道</strong>：价格事实从哪来、多久采一次、怎样判断「变了」、以及变了的信号进入流处理之后如何在乱序与重复中被压成唯一的边沿。这两件事容易混为一谈——把「抓到了新价格」直接当成「降价了」，就得到一个在分币抖动下疯狂发信、在反爬封禁下悄悄停摆的系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>采集是<strong>采样</strong>，不是观测。定时任务在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1, t_2, \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span> 抓到的是一串离散快照，两次采样之间的价格轨迹是未知的。因此系统能检测到的最小降价幅度，取决于采样间隔与价格波动速率：间隔越长，越快回弹的短促折扣越容易整个漏掉；而间隔越短，单位成本与封禁风险越高。这个「采样率 ↔ 覆盖度 ↔ 成本」的三角是整条管道的第一性权衡，而不是一个可以事后调的旋钮。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[采集调度器&lt;br/&gt;分层频率 + 抖动] --&gt; F[抓取器&lt;br/&gt;条件请求 / API]&#10;  F --&gt; P[解析与规范化&lt;br/&gt;币种 / 单位 / 变体映射]&#10;  P --&gt; C{变更检测&lt;br/&gt;指纹比对}&#10;  C --&gt;|未变| S[写心跳&lt;br/&gt;不产生事件]&#10;  C --&gt;|变了| E[价格变更事件&lt;br/&gt;带幂等键]&#10;  E --&gt; W[流处理&lt;br/&gt;水位线 + 乱序缓冲]&#10;  W --&gt; D{去抖&lt;br/&gt;滞后带 / 冷却}&#10;  D --&gt;|通过| T[触发下游]&#10;  D --&gt;|拦截| X[落档不发送]\">graph TD\n  Q[采集调度器&lt;br/&gt;分层频率 + 抖动] --&gt; F[抓取器&lt;br/&gt;条件请求 / API]\n  F --&gt; P[解析与规范化&lt;br/&gt;币种 / 单位 / 变体映射]\n  P --&gt; C{变更检测&lt;br/&gt;指纹比对}\n  C --&gt;|未变| S[写心跳&lt;br/&gt;不产生事件]\n  C --&gt;|变了| E[价格变更事件&lt;br/&gt;带幂等键]\n  E --&gt; W[流处理&lt;br/&gt;水位线 + 乱序缓冲]\n  W --&gt; D{去抖&lt;br/&gt;滞后带 / 冷却}\n  D --&gt;|通过| T[触发下游]\n  D --&gt;|拦截| X[落档不发送]</pre><p>三类数据源决定了管道的形状：<strong>官方 API</strong>（平台或 ERP 提供商品/库存/价格端点）、<strong>结构化数据</strong>（页面上由商家主动嵌入的机器可读块）、<strong>原始页面抓取</strong>（无接口时的兜底）。三者的延迟、覆盖、法律与稳定性风险差别很大，混在一套调度里会让成本失控。变更检测与去抖则是两件不同的事：前者消掉「抓了但没变」的无效事件，后者消掉「确实变了但没意义」的噪声。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>检测延迟</th>\n<th>覆盖度</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n<th>调度策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>官方 API / Webhook</td>\n<td>秒至分钟</td>\n<td>仅自家/授权商家</td>\n<td>配额与速率限制</td>\n<td>事件驱动 + 兜底轮询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化数据块</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>仅嵌入该块的页面</td>\n<td>字段缺失、被商家漏更</td>\n<td>按站点批量抓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原始页面抓取</td>\n<td>取决于频率</td>\n<td>最广</td>\n<td>反爬封禁、布局变更、合规</td>\n<td>分层抽样 + 退避</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"价格采集的三种数据源与成本模型\">价格采集的三种数据源与成本模型</h2><p>官方 API 是首选，因为它把「解析」这一步变成了契约内的字段读取，且平台通常用变更事件替代轮询。Shopify 的库存沿用 <code>InventoryLevel</code> 这类按（库存项，位置）拆分的对象，价格与商品数据也有对应的 Admin GraphQL 端点（来源：Shopify Admin API 文档，<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql）。这类接口的代价是可预期的速率限制：调度器应当以「每店铺每秒请求预算」为单位分配，而不是给每个商品一个固定间隔。\">https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql）。这类接口的代价是可预期的速率限制：调度器应当以「每店铺每秒请求预算」为单位分配，而不是给每个商品一个固定间隔。</a></p>\n<p>结构化数据是中间地带。Google 的 Merchant Center 商品数据规范与 schema.org 的 <code>Product</code> / <code>Offer</code> 词汇把价格、币种、促销价定义成机器可读字段，<code>price</code> 表示当前售价、<code>sale_price</code> 表示促销价（来源：Google Merchant Center 商品数据规范，<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7052112；schema.org\">https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7052112；schema.org</a> <code>Offer</code>，<a href=\"https://schema.org/Offer）。抓取器读这两个字段就能绕过大量\">https://schema.org/Offer）。抓取器读这两个字段就能绕过大量</a> DOM 结构猜测——<strong>优先读商家自述的字段，而不是从渲染结果里反推</strong>，因为后者在布局改版时会静默失败。</p>\n<p>原始抓取是最后的兜底，成本和风险最高。它有两个必须显式化的合规约束：一是目标站点的 <code>robots.txt</code> 与条款，二是请求身份。抓取频率必须能证明与被监测商品的价值相称，而不是对所有 URL 一视同仁地高频轮询。RFC 9309（Robots Exclusion Protocol）给出了 <code>robots.txt</code> 的行为规范，包含 <code>crawl-delay</code> 语义与 User-Agent 匹配规则（来源：RFC 9309，<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9309.html）。\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9309.html）。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"变更检测-条件请求与价格规范化\">变更检测：条件请求与价格规范化</h2><p>抓取器最容易被浪费掉的一步是「抓回来发现没变」。HTTP 的条件请求正是为此设计的：服务器通过 <code>ETag</code> 或 <code>Last-Modified</code> 提供资源版本的<strong>校验器</strong>，客户端下次带上 <code>If-None-Match</code> 或 <code>If-Modified-Since</code>，未变化时服务器回 <code>304 Not Modified</code>，没有响应体（来源：MDN，HTTP 条件请求，<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Conditional_requests）。注意\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Conditional_requests）。注意</a> <code>304</code> <strong>仍然消耗一次网络往返</strong>——它省的是带宽与解析，不是连接数；对按请求计费或按次数触发风控的场景，收益要单独核算。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>savings</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>unchanged</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{savings} = \\frac{N_{\\text{unchanged}} \\cdot (|B| - |h|)}{N_{\\text{total}} \\cdot |B|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">savings</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unchanged</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|B|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是页面字节数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|h|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是响应头字节数。当页面大而变更率低（这是价格监测的常态）时节省显著；当变更率高或页面很小时，条件请求的价值主要是削峰而非省流量。</p>\n<p>结构化数据侧没有 HTTP 校验器，需要自己算<strong>变更指纹</strong>。指纹必须建立在<strong>规范化后的价格事实</strong>上，而不是原始文本上：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>抽取出 (标识, 币种, 金额, 口径, 观测时间) 五元组，口径区分现价与促销价。</li>\n<li>金额转成最小货币单位整数（分），消除 <code>199</code>、<code>199.0</code>、<code>199.00</code> 的表示差异。</li>\n<li>对字段做稳定序列化（键排序、去空白）后哈希，得到版本号。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>规范化漏掉任何一步都会产生假变更。最常见的假变更来自<strong>渲染噪声</strong>：时间戳、推荐位轮换、A/B 实验分组写在同一个 DOM 里，若不隔离价格字段所在的子树，指纹每轮都不同，<code>304</code> 与本地哈希双双失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调度器-分层频率-抖动与优先级队列\">调度器：分层频率、抖动与优先级队列</h2><p>把全网商品塞进一条固定周期的轮询队列，是绝大多数价格监测系统的第一个性能悬崖。正确做法是按「价值 × 波动率」分层，让少数高价值 SKU 密采、长尾稀疏采。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分层</th>\n<th>典型对象</th>\n<th>采样间隔</th>\n<th>触发上调的信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热</td>\n<td>在售且高需求、正在被大量订阅</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>高订阅数、近期已降价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温</td>\n<td>正常在售</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n<td>进入促销季</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷</td>\n<td>长尾、低订阅</td>\n<td>天级</td>\n<td>被加入心愿单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归档</td>\n<td>已下架/停产变体</td>\n<td>周级或停止</td>\n<td>变体复活</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个调度细节决定成败。其一是<strong>抖动</strong>（jitter）：若所有商品都在整点被扫，源站会看到脉冲式流量并据此限流；给每个商品一个确定性的伪随机相位偏移可以摊平负载，且偏移由商品 ID 派生，重启后可复现。其二是<strong>退避</strong>：遇到 429 或 403 时必须指数退避并按主机隔离熔断，而不是重试到底——把封禁当成临时错误重试，只会把 IP 段更快地推入黑名单。请求节奏还应显式尊重目标站的 <code>crawl-delay</code>（见 RFC 9309）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>next</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{next}} = t_{\\text{now}} + \\max\\bigl(i_{\\text{base}} \\cdot 2^{\\,k},\\; i_{\\max}\\bigr) \\cdot (1 + u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">next</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2491em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是连续失败次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基础间隔，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u \\in [0, u_{\\max}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是抖动因子。退避上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与「分层间隔」是两个独立通道：前者管风控退让，后者管正常采样密度，混用会让一次封禁把整个 SKU 永久降级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"乱序-重复与水位线\">乱序、重复与水位线</h2><p>价格变更事件进入流处理层之后，问题从「网络」变成「时间」。同一个 SKU 的多个事件可能来自不同采集节点、不同时间到达，且事件自带的观测时间戳与到达时间不同。若按到达顺序逐条与「当前价格」比较，一条迟到但更早的旧价格会把已确立的低点顶掉，产生一次虚假的「回升」或「下降」。</p>\n<p>标准解法是<strong>水位线</strong>（watermark）：流处理器推进一个「已确认收齐 <code>T</code> 之前所有事件」的水位，只对水位之下的事件做边沿判定，把水位之上的迟到事件放进有界缓冲。Apache Flink 的事件时间与水印模型是这套机制的成熟实现（来源：Apache Flink 文档，Event Time and Watermarks，<a href=\"https://nightlies.apache.org/flink/flink-docs-stable/docs/concepts/time/）。缓冲必须有界，否则一个长期不推进的分区会撑爆内存——超出界限的事件按策略丢弃或降级为「观测但不触发」。\">https://nightlies.apache.org/flink/flink-docs-stable/docs/concepts/time/）。缓冲必须有界，否则一个长期不推进的分区会撑爆内存——超出界限的事件按策略丢弃或降级为「观测但不触发」。</a></p>\n<p>与水位线配套的是<strong>幂等键</strong>。事件键应是 (商品, 变体, 币种, 口径, 观测时点) 的确定性组合，而不是随机 UUID。重复投递（至少一次语义下的重发）因此可以被下游天然去重，无需依赖恰好一次语义。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[事件到达&lt;br/&gt;观测时间乱序] --&gt; B{观测时间 &lt; 水位?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[进入边沿判定]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D[有界缓冲&lt;br/&gt;按观测时间排序]&#10;  D --&gt;|水位推进| C&#10;  D --&gt;|超出界限| E[降级&lt;br/&gt;观测不触发]&#10;  C --&gt; F[与上一已确立价比较]&#10;  F --&gt; G[产生下降/回升边沿]\">graph TD\n  A[事件到达&lt;br/&gt;观测时间乱序] --&gt; B{观测时间 &lt; 水位?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[进入边沿判定]\n  B --&gt;|否| D[有界缓冲&lt;br/&gt;按观测时间排序]\n  D --&gt;|水位推进| C\n  D --&gt;|超出界限| E[降级&lt;br/&gt;观测不触发]\n  C --&gt; F[与上一已确立价比较]\n  F --&gt; G[产生下降/回升边沿]</pre><h2 id=\"去抖与合并-从边沿到唯一一次打扰\">去抖与合并：从边沿到唯一一次打扰</h2><p>有了干净的价格时间序列，去抖才有意义。触发语义、滞后带与复位条件属于 <a href=\"alert-trigger-condition-model\">提醒触发条件建模</a> 的范畴；这里只补充<strong>采样与去抖的耦合</strong>：滞后带 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 必须大于一个采样周期内可观测的正常波动幅度，否则阈值附近的抖动会以采样频率反复穿越触发与复位线。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>reset</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>h</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{reset}} = p_{\\text{target}} \\cdot (1 + h), \\qquad h &gt; \\frac{\\sigma_{\\Delta p}}{p_{\\text{target}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0797em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{\\Delta p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是相邻采样间价差的典型标准差。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 小于它，系统在「触发—复位—触发」之间高频振荡；若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 过大，真实的二次降价会被吞掉。经验做法是从近 30 天该品类相邻采样价差的分布取分位数，随品类自动标定，而非全局固定一个百分比。</p>\n<p>多采集节点、多数据源带来的<strong>同一次降价的多路事件</strong>，需要在去抖之前按 (商品, 变体, 币种) 归并到一个逻辑流上，否则同一个门店调价会被当成互相独立的三次降价。归并键与水位线一致，落地为一次「分组 + 去重 + 取最早有效观测」的操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>采集是<strong>采样</strong>：能检测到的最小降价幅度由采样间隔与波动速率共同决定，采样率 ↔ 覆盖度 ↔ 成本是必须先定的三角。</li>\n<li>数据源三分：官方 API（契约内字段、按配额调度）＞结构化数据（读商家自述的 <code>price</code> / <code>sale_price</code>，见 Merchant Center 商品数据规范）＞原始抓取（受 RFC 9309 <code>robots.txt</code> 与 <code>crawl-delay</code> 约束，风险最高）。</li>\n<li>变更检测用<strong>条件请求</strong>（<code>ETag</code> / <code>Last-Modified</code> + <code>If-None-Match</code>，<code>304</code> 仍耗一次往返，见 MDN 条件请求）削掉「抓了没变」；无校验器时用<strong>规范化价格事实的指纹</strong>，规范化漏一步就是假变更。</li>\n<li>调度器要<strong>分层频率 + 确定性抖动 + 指数退避 + 主机级熔断</strong>；退避上限与分层间隔是两个独立通道，不可混用。</li>\n<li>乱序用<strong>事件时间水位线 + 有界缓冲</strong>处理（Flink 文档），重复用<strong>确定性幂等键</strong>去重，多源多节点先归并再判定。</li>\n<li>去抖的滞后带 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 必须大于一个采样周期内的正常波动，且应按品类从历史价差分布自动标定；本文只覆盖管道机制，触发语义与复位条件见 <a href=\"alert-trigger-condition-model\">提醒触发条件建模</a>，投递侧见 <a href=\"../notification-delivery-realtime/\">通知投递与实时通道</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"价格采集、降价检测与调度去抖机制","id":"价格采集-降价检测与调度去抖机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"价格采集的三种数据源与成本模型","id":"价格采集的三种数据源与成本模型"},{"level":2,"text":"变更检测：条件请求与价格规范化","id":"变更检测-条件请求与价格规范化"},{"level":2,"text":"调度器：分层频率、抖动与优先级队列","id":"调度器-分层频率-抖动与优先级队列"},{"level":2,"text":"乱序、重复与水位线","id":"乱序-重复与水位线"},{"level":2,"text":"去抖与合并：从边沿到唯一一次打扰","id":"去抖与合并-从边沿到唯一一次打扰"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"提醒触发条件建模：库存回补、价格阈值与变体粒度订阅","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/restock-price-alert-engine/alert-trigger-condition-model"},"next":{"title":"到货通知的库存竞争、超卖与虚假回补异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/restock-price-alert-engine/backinstock-oversell-false-alarm"}}